<title>AUSTRIA: Creditanstalt sees huge rise in 1997 net.</title>
<headline>Creditanstalt sees huge rise in 1997 net.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Creditanstalt said on Friday it expected to turn in a significantly higher net profit in 1997 after reporting a 70 percent surge in net profit in the first six months.</p>
<p>Creditanstalt's group net profit in the first half soared to 2.2 billion schillings ($170.5 million) from 1.3 billion in the year-ago period. ($ = 12.90 Austrian Schillings)</p>
</text>
